      "value": "@{5a4baea4758fa46d131cd5e2|full_name}: On the one side I think you were probably just lucky the first few days to encounter less people with better optimized avatars. But there are also some bugs affecting performance that might also be of concern. There is a memory issue: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/memory-leaks\nAnd there are issues with the SteamVR overlay: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/steam-overlay-randomly-causes-semi-permanent-low-fps\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/steamvr-and-oculus-lag\nI am also pretty sure there were some issues with programms like msi afterburner or fraps.\nThere is also an issue with instances being online for a very long time.\nAnd there is an issue with updates on instances: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/when-a-world-is-updated-current-instances-become-unjoinable",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
