  "details": "I have played VRChat for a couple of days now with vive. the game played pretty good with no real issue. All of the sudden whenever I use my vive I'll get really bad stuttering and lag whenever there's many people in a room. a loading icon with the VRChat logo will appear then disappear.\nI've tried reinstalling the game but it only solves the problem for a few minutes.\n\nspecs are fx 8350, 8gb of ram and gtx 1080",
